<title>UK: Ex-dividends to take 0.63 points off FTSE, Sep 30.</title>
<headline>Ex-dividends to take 0.63 points off FTSE, Sep 30.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following FTSE 100 index stocks will go ex-dividend on September 30 and analysts estimate the effect will be to take 0.63 points off the index that day.</p>
<p>						 DIVIDEND    INDEX</p>
<p>						 (PENCE)     EFFECT</p>
<p>	COMPANY				 Net   Gross  Gross</p>
<p>* Enterprise Oil			    6.50  8.125  0.236</p>
<p>* Kingfisher				  5.00  6.250  0.244</p>
<p>* Rentokil Group			    1.48  1.850  0.152</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7954</p>
</text>
